\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/38px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/50px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png/25px-Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Portrait_Tolna_Tome-Monger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tolna_Tome-Monger\" title=\"Tolna Tome-Monger\">Tolna Tome-Monger</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Sundries\" title=\"Sorcerous Sundries\">Sorcerous Sundries</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This tome covers the nature of dead magic zones.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nDuring an era called the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Time_of_Troubles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Time of Troubles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Time_of_Troubles\">Time of Troubles</a></span>, a good many changes befell the world, not least of which was the fracturing and reassembling of the source of all magic called the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Weave\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Weave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Weave\">Weave</a></span>. Though much of the world has recovered from that era, some sites remain scourged of magical power. Cut off from the Weave, they nullify all magic and spellcasting nearby...\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See Also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Impractical_Magic,_Volume_1\" title=\"Impractical Magic, Volume 1\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Bound_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Bound_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Bound_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Bound_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Book_Bound_A_Item_